§§ `The top-level goal`

GIVEN r IS A `Parent role`, e IS A `Child event`, n IS A NUMBER, w IS A `Work facts`, both IS A BOOLEAN, elected IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Parent case`
`a parent` r e n w both elected MEANS `Parent case` WITH
    `role` IS r
    `event` IS e
    `specified event number` IS n
    `work` IS w
    `lawfully married to the other parent in time` IS TRUE
    `the other parent is also eligible for shared parental leave` IS both
    `units allocated under the arrangement` IS NOTHING
    `weeks elected by the mother under s 12E(5)` IS elected

